[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナちゃん、何の本読んでるの？\nあれ、それって……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Whatcha reading there, Resna? Wait, isn't that..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん、ララさ……アラルさんの本だよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah, it's Lar— I mean, Allar's book."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今回の旅にも持ってきたんだねぇ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You brought it with you on this journey too, huh?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私にとって特別な本だし、\nどんな時でも初心を忘れたくないなって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's a special book to me. I want to remember where I started, no matter what."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "その気持ち、アタシも分かる！\u3000アタシもさ、\nこの旅に出る前に騎士の本を読み返してきたんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I totally get that! Before we left, I reread my book about knights too!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えっ、騎士の本って……私があげたやつ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wait, the book about knights... the one I gave you?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん。レスナちゃんが出会わせてくれた\nアタシの一番大好きな本だよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yep! It's my absolute favorite book—the one you introduced me to!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふっ、そう言ってくれて嬉しい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe, I'm glad you feel that way."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そういえば、ヨハナにもプレゼントしてたよね、本。\n読んでくれてるかな？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh yeah, you gave Johanna a book too, didn't you? Wonder if she's read it..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "少しは……気晴らしになるといいけど",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I hope it helps take her mind off things, at least a little..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ただいま",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I'm back."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヨハナちゃん、おかえり。\nオリバーさんの容体、どうだった？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Welcome back, Johanna. How's Oliver doing?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……いつ倒れてもおかしくないって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...They say he could collapse at any moment."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ごめんね、レスナ。\n今回の旅……私は一緒に行けないと思う",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm sorry, Resna. I don't think I can join you on this journey."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今、おじいちゃんのそばを\n離れるわけにはいかないから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I can't leave Grandpa's side right now."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私のことは気にしなくていいよ。\n今はオリバーさんのそばにいてあげて",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Don't worry about me. You should stay with Oliver."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヨハナちゃんがいてくれれば、\nオリバーさんもきっと元気になるから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm sure having you there will help him get better."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ん",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Mm."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そっか。ヨハナも行けなくなったのか～",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So Johanna can't make it either, huh?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "「も」ってことは……あんたも？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "'Either'? Don't tell me you..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まー、元の家族とちょっとね。\nなんかややこしいことになってるみたいでさ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah, well... Some complicated stuff's come up with my old family."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ほったらかしにしたまま、\n逃げるわけにもいかないっていうか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Can't exactly run away and leave it all hanging, y'know?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ハイディ、私にできることはある？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi, is there anything I can do?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ははっ、大丈夫だよ相棒！\n自分でちゃんとケリをつけてくるから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Haha, don't worry about it, partner! I'll sort this out myself."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あんたは、レスナの力になってあげて",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You focus on helping Resna."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そう……分かったわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see... alright."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ま、すぐに用事が済めば、\n船出に間に合うかもしれないしね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, if I wrap things up quick enough, I might still make it in time for departure!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私だって、あんなヤツらといるより、\n今の家族と一緒に船旅を楽しみたいもんね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'd much rather be on a ship adventure with my real family than stuck with those folks anyway!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]